5. `v2-⑧-2b` (`272`): likely path `docker-compose.prod.yml`, compose tests/lints, maybe docs. Required labels: `area:devops`, `area:deployment`, `area:ops`. Suggested `required_paths: [docker-compose.prod.yml, docs/ops/**, scripts/**]`.

