   394	| 1 | v2-⑥-1a | Image-vs-DB drift spec + Option C ADR rationale | S | claude | D1+D2+D4 (spec) | G.A-v1-19 |
   395	| 2 | v2-⑥-2a | ADR-0036 forward-only-deploy invariant (canary-runner canonical path; Option C asymmetric upgrade) | S | claude | D4 (recovery contract) | v2-⑥-1a |
   396	| 3 | v2-⑥-1bc | `alembic_drift` Prometheus gauge promoted to always-on routine scrape (decouple from /readyz call) + tests | S | codex | D1 | v2-⑥-1a |
   397	| 4 | v2-⑥-2bc | Backend startup `alembic upgrade head` hook (idempotent; fail-fast if behind DB) + tests | S | codex | D4 | v2-⑥-2a |
