   206	**Design forward-compat checklist** (the 7 AM-integration pitfalls we plan around now):
   207	
   208	| Pitfall | Mitigation baked into framework |
   209	|---|---|
   210	| Label/annotation semantic drift between rule and AM | Required-label schema fixed in v2-AlertBridge-Framework: `severity`, `area`, `family`, `defense_dimension`; required annotations: `summary`, `description`, `runbook_url`, `remediation_hint` |
