- AlertBridge no longer promises byte-for-byte transport equivalence.
- §6 filing graph now includes AlertBridge and the ⑨ typo is fixed.

What got worse or remained rough:
- The SD-1 evidence block is weaker than it looks because commands fail in the current checkout.
