- Ticket headings and effort estimates were not updated after adding v1.3 tickets.
- The spec grew to 70 tickets; tier coherence is still acceptable, but the family is now a major program rather than a compact amendment.

Net assessment: round-1 blockers are mostly resolved. v1.3 is substantially more fileable than v1.1, with a small conditional cleanup needed before filing the affected tickets.

